<!-- speed 200 ~= 833 uL / 10 sec 
     1 uL corresponds to 1.2 pump position units
     speed  33 corresponds to 1 mL / min (slow) 60 s/ml
     speed  66 corresponds to 2 mL / min (med)  30 s ml
	 speed 100 corresponds to 3 ml / min (fast) 20 s/ml
-->
